    "ruleType": "detachment-rule",
    "group": "Shadowkeepers",
    "summary": "Melee attacks against one of your ADEPTUS CUSTODES units, other than a MONSTER or VEHICLE unit, that is in range of an **[objective](vsdata:core-rule/objectives)** get −1 to their wound rolls if their Strength exceeds that unit’s Toughness. Favoured Ka'tah: Kaptaris. When you select the Kaptaris ka’tah ability of **[Martial Ka'tah](vsdata:ability/adeptus-custodes.martial-katah)** for a readied unit, you may also make an enemy unit that is engaged with it take a battle-shock roll, subtracting 1 from that roll; a given enemy unit can be chosen for this only once per phase.",
